                                "example_id": "8fc227cb-ddbb-48a0-ab30-7309e177fd7e",
                                "sense_id": "9852617f-3b68-3400-acf0-e1a3160f73e7",
                                "text": "He is also aware that, teamwise, it's not a bad strategy to stay closer to Roger's camp than to Doug and Jamie's, who seem to be getting more enthusiastic about paddling..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3672b973-95db-4549-956a-d903d9f99465",
                                "sense_id": "9852617f-3b68-3400-acf0-e1a3160f73e7",
                                "text": "\"We got some good things done teamwise,\" Green said the following day. \"I think we're as close a ballclub right now than we have been in a long time.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4877b481-418d-43f5-b75d-27f92dee7544",
                                "sense_id": "9852617f-3b68-3400-acf0-e1a3160f73e7",
                                "text": "Teamwise, this shortening of all organizational functions brings the support and stability of the management process closer to the day-to-day work of the team members who make up the foundation."
                            }
